# The dump-hash sample (tools/dump-hash.sh): one root per line, staged as a fake HOME.
#
#   corpus <harness>/<version>   a committed corpus version (crates/cv-core/tests/corpus/…)
#   synthetic <edge>             a generated Claude edge: giant | escaped | malformed | live
#   home <abs dir>               an external fake HOME of real sessions — NEVER committed. Build it
#                                with `cp -c` of ~30 sessions into <dir>/.claude/projects/<proj>/ and
#                                <dir>/.codex/sessions/YYYY/MM/DD/, or pass it as `--home <dir>`.
